Bind Npc 21810

On greeting
    If player is priest and player skill points in tree 5 > 29
        Say "What kind of holy water do you wish to obtain?"
        Topic "Holy Water of Life" goto life
        If player skill points in tree 5 > 39
            Topic "Holy Water of Love" goto love
        If player skill points in tree 5 > 49
            Topic "Holy Water of Grace" goto grace
        If player skill points in tree 5 > 59
            Topic "Holy Water of Favors" goto favors
        Topic "No, I'll just go." goto close
    Else
        Say "Only priests possessing the holy healing skill above 30 can learn holy water production. "
        Topic "Confirm" goto close

On life
    If player lacks 389010000
        Say "You don't have enough holy water."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
    Else if player lacks 379001000
        Say "You don't have enough prayers."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
    Else if player can receive 1 of 389011000
        Say "Are you ready to learn the secrets of holy water production?"
        Topic "Production " do
            Transaction
                Take 1 of 389010000
                Take 1 of 379001000
                Give 1 of 389011000
            If quest 159 is unstarted
                Complete 159
        Topic "Cancel" goto close
    Else
        Say "You have exceeded the weight limit. You cannot produce holy water."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close

